-implies hypercontractivity. Combined with LSI applied to `f^{p/2}`
-and the chain rule for `(d/dt) ‖P_t f‖_p^p`, it closes the
-differential inequality `(d/dt) ‖P_t f‖_{q(t)} ≤ 0` along the path
-`q(t) = 1 + (p − 1) · e^{2ρt}`. -/
